### VS Code (REST Client) / Rider / Visual Studio
@host = http://localhost:5090
# Nếu bật Security:ApiKey, thêm dòng:  X-API-Key: <key>

### DNS
GET {{host}}/api/diagnostics/dns/example.com

### Ping (ICMP)
GET {{host}}/api/diagnostics/ping/example.com?count=4

### Kiểm tra cổng TCP
GET {{host}}/api/diagnostics/tcp?host=example.com&port=443

### Kiểm tra HTTP (không tự theo redirect)
GET {{host}}/api/diagnostics/http?url=https://example.com

### Thông tin chứng chỉ TLS
GET {{host}}/api/diagnostics/tls?host=example.com&port=443

### Bị chặn (SSRF guard): địa chỉ nội bộ -> 403
GET {{host}}/api/diagnostics/tcp?host=127.0.0.1&port=80

### Gọi API ngoài qua typed HttpClient
GET {{host}}/api/external/holidays/2026/VN

###
GET {{host}}/api/external/public-ip

### Server-Sent Events
GET {{host}}/api/stream/time?count=5&intervalMs=500

### Thông tin request / server
GET {{host}}/api/info/request

###
GET {{host}}/api/info/server

### Health
GET {{host}}/health
